  "description": "The Daybird is our tribute to the classic, steel-framed, 3-speed bike.\n\nIt’s inspired by the popular bikes of the 1960’s, but loaded up with modern refinements. On the classic side you’ll find Sturmey Archer 3-speed hub combined with a durable and intuitive aluminum thumb shifter. The Daybird’s high-quality steel frame is based around a time-proven comfortable riding position. On the modern side you’ll find an 1-1/8” threadless headset and lightweight aluminum 3-piece cranks.\n\nThe latest version of the Daybird uses a threaded English bottom bracket specification, and tires that are protected by an extra-thick tread.\n\nChoose the Daybird as a Standard (Black) or Step-thru (Turquoise).",
